able video display, allowing you to preview and capture video input in real-time. Simply connect a UVC capture card, and instantly expand your viewing experience. Whether you\u2019re extending your gaming screen, monitoring a camera feed, or showcasing educational content, CapView brings seamless video display to your VR headset.\n\n**Try CapView for free today and enhance your visual workflow in VR!**\n\n# Key Features\n- Capture and preview video using UVC capture devices.\n- Intuitive interface to adjust resolution and frame rate.\n- Flexible zoom and mirroring controls to optimize your video composition.\n\n# Requirements:\n\n- Compatible with Meta Quest headsets (Quest 2, Quest 3, Quest Pro).\n- Requires a UVC capture device to input video.\n\n# Support\n\nFor any feedback or inquiries, feel free to contact us at: support@displaypass.org", "short_description": "CapView \u2013 Video Capture & Preview for Meta Quest\n\nTurn your Meta Quest into a portable video display with CapView! Connect a UVC capture card to preview and capture video in real-time\u2014perfect for gaming, camera monitoring, or educational content.\n\n#Features:\n1. Capture & preview video via UVC devices\n2. Adjust resolution & frame rate\n3. Zoom & mirror for better composition\n\n#Support:\nPlease feel free to contact us: support@displaypass.org"}]}, "developer_name": "Connect Dollar Co., Ltd", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.displaypass.org/capview/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "DisplayPass", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.displaypass.org/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1055187466124150"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, 